		longDescription: "A schema-driven visual builder for customizable ecommerce store templates. Users design multi-page storefronts by adding, reordering, and configuring sections like heroes, product grids, and reviews, then customize theme tokens for color, typography, and spacing. Templates persist per account via Neon and Drizzle, product images upload through Cloudflare R2, and finished storefronts can be shared via password-protected preview links or exported as static HTML/CSS or a ready-to-run Next.js storefront project.",
