		longDescription: "Workbench is a personal, local-first command center for managing coding projects, built as a Tauri desktop app with a React frontend and a Rust backend handling filesystem, Git, process, and SQLite operations. It surfaces project-linked tasks, activity history, and health-check commands across an entire folder of repositories, plus an automations layer for recurring project workflows. Built purely for personal use to stay organized across many concurrent side projects.",
		tags: ["React", "Tauri", "Rust", "TypeScript", "SQLite"],
